{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder, achieving 52.03% validation accuracy and 49.82% F1, slightly lower than the multimodal baseline with the same encoder (config_004: 53.62% accuracy). The result suggests the scvi_n200 encoder's performance may be modality-specific rather than synergistic with image data, but the absence of direct comparisons to other unimodal baselines leaves uncertainty about encoder choice impacts and the role of fusion strategies."
}

